      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "他肯定地说：“不后悔。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He said firmly, \"I do not regret it.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01298",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "她抚摸着他的手说道：“我也不后悔。”",
